  "display_name": "Hill Dwarf",
  "description": "Bold and hardy, dwarves are known as skilled warriors, miners, and workers of stone and metal.\n\n\r\nRacial Traits\n+2 Constitution, Darkvision, Dwarven Resilience, Dwarven Combat Training, Stonecunning\n\nAs a hill dwarf, you have keen senses, deep intuition, and remarkable resilience. The gold dwarves of Faer&ucirc;n in their mighty southern kingdom are hill dwarves, as are the exiled Neidar and the debased Klar of Krynn in the Dragonlance setting.",
